{"ID":"20240504161427-isnfbs9","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161427-isnfbs9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161427-isnfbs9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504164136-u1ywubt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607150119-abr580q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4552,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617111144-pxw4oqs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:61,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:61\u0026#125;","title":"107杜仲","type":"doc","updated":"20240811093502"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504164136-1j1rtox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504164136-1j1rtox","updated":"20240504164136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产贵州、四川、陕西、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t干燥树皮，为平坦的板片状或卷片状，大小厚薄不一，一般厚约310mm，长约40100cm。外表面灰棕色，粗糙，有不规则纵裂槽纹及斜方形横裂皮孔，有时可见淡灰色地衣斑。但商品多已削去部分糙皮，故外表面淡棕色，较平滑。内表面光滑，暗紫色。质脆易折断，断面有银白色丝状物相连，细密，略有伸缩性。气微，味稍苦，嚼之有胶状残余物。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t补肝肾，强筋骨，安胎。治腰脊酸疼，足膝痿弱，小便余沥，阴下湿痒，胎漏欲堕，胎动不安，高血压。\n【附注】\t杜仲 (Eucommia ulmoides) 在《世界自然保护联盟濒危物种红色名录》中被列为易危物种。"}]},{"ID":"20240504164136-wdsvcdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504164136-wdsvcdc","updated":"20240504164136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135046-bzzwsxh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240504164136-23ds8ht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504164136-23ds8ht","updated":"20240504164136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杜仲"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杜仲-20240205165748-kfuhr0y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240620165543-5ecxbnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620165543-5ecxbnu","updated":"20240811093502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 453px;","style":"width: 443px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620165543-uik0ebe.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 443px;\" parent-style=\"width: 453px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 453px;","style":"width: 443px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620165609-fkbo205.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 443px;\" parent-style=\"width: 453px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811093047-n8ceumb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811093047-n8ceumb","updated":"20240811093454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 509px;","style":"width: 499px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杜仲 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杜仲 1-20240811093047-9qrzda0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 499px;\" parent-style=\"width: 509px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 677px;","style":"width: 667px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杜仲 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杜仲 3-20240811093211-urbkb22.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 667px;\" parent-style=\"width: 677px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715090106-5l2mdz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715090106-5l2mdz0","updated":"20240811093453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 594px;","style":"width: 584px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杜仲 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杜仲 1-20240715090119-7fxnkrd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 584px;\" parent-style=\"width: 594px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杜仲"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杜仲-20240715090100-y2614u7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715090350-afw5at7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715090350-afw5at7","updated":"20240811093450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 502px;","style":"width: 492px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杜仲 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杜仲 2-20240715090350-gm7xoiq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCl